dict(title='Lobot (Dark)',printed_title='Lobot',side='Dark',type='Character',subtype='Alien',original_set='Cloud City',set_icon='Cloud City',destiny='1',power='2',ability='2',deploy='2',forfeit='3',icons=['Alien'],lore='Son of a traveling slaver. Helps run Cloud City with Administrator Lando Calrissian. Speech capability worn away by constant cyborg neural connection.',game_text='Deploys only on Cloud City. Power +2 when present at a Scomp link. If present at a site, can be replaced by opponent with any Light Side Lobot. While present on Cloud City with your Lando, prevents replacement of Lobot and Lando.'),
dict(title='Visage Of The Emperor',side='Dark',type='Effect',original_set='Dagobah',set_icon='Dagobah',destiny='7',icons=['Effect'],lore='Palpatine’s hologram. Imposing. Ominous. Intimidating. Instrument for the evil Emperor’s sinister reach across the galaxy. Used on a secret frequency of the Imperial HoloNet.',game_text='Lose 2 Force to deploy on Executor: Holotheatre or Death Star: Conference Room. At the end of each player’s turn, each player must lose 1 Force. Effect canceled if opponent controls this site. (Immune to Alter.)'),
